research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-topology-uniform.log-23726-[L4] The dyadic weights $2^{-n}=(1/2)^n$ are positive, satisfy the rational power laws, strictly decrease with $n$, and tend to $0$ ([[lem-rational-power-laws]], claims 1 and 2, [[lem-rational-power-monotone]], claim 1, and [[lem-geometric-sequence-null]], claim 1).
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-topology-uniform.log-23727-
