research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-topology-uniform.log-23729-[L1] For every entourage, dependent choice supplies a normal sequence whose first nontrivial member is contained in that entourage ([[lem-normal-sequences-of-entourages]]).
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-topology-uniform.log-23730-[L2] Such a sequence yields a uniformly continuous pseudometric whose dyadic balls lie between consecutive entourages ([[lem-pseudometric-from-a-normal-entourage-sequence]]).
