research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-topology-uniform.log-260025-+          "quote": "In ZF, an entourage uniformity determines a uniform-cover structure by the covers $\\{E[x]:x\\in X\\}$, and a uniform-cover structure determines an entourage uniformity by the sets $\\bigcup_{V\\in\\mathcal V}V\\times V$. These constructions recover the same uniform structure.",
